1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Threatened by a ruthless demon, humanity was on the brink of destruction.

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:16,000
All seemed lost until a lone mage stepped forward and took up the fight.

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:28,000
After his triumph, he was hailed as the Wizard King, and his story became legend.

4
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:38,000
After hearing Yami's tale about how never giving up can open new doors, Asta was filled with fresh resolve to face his rival.

5
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Alright! Time to work hard, catch up to Yuno, and leave him behind!

6
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Just then.

7
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Damn! That's the biggest outlet I've ever heard.

8
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Quit banging the door down! If you're looking for Captain Yami's black bullet, then you came to the ra-

9
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Whoa! What just happened?

10
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:59,000
Hey, I recognize her!

11
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:01,000
That's Poigolian's sister!

12
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:02,000
That's Poigolian's sister!

13
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:03,000
That's Poigolian's sister!

14
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:04,000
That's Poigolian's sister!

15
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:05,000
ev Cat

16
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:10,000
You can spot your toes

17
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:32,000
And make all those guys

18
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:36,060
I'll see you soon now.

19
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:31,980
We'll be right back, we'll be right back, we'll be right back.

20
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:41,040
Dude, what is this about? Is the captain of the Crimson Lion Kings really here?

21
00:02:41,600 --> 00:02:45,680
Mm-hmm. Yeah, Captain, why are you showing up on our doorstep out of nowhere?

22
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:47,440
It's Mara Leona!

23
00:02:50,220 --> 00:02:53,380
Hey, why is it so damn noisy in here all of a sudden?

24
00:02:53,600 --> 00:02:55,820
Sheesh, can't a guy even take a dump? Oh.

25
00:02:56,420 --> 00:02:58,060
Dangerous animal on the loose!

26
00:02:58,300 --> 00:03:01,140
Everybody, hurry up and get out of the building now!

27
00:03:01,140 --> 00:03:03,780
No! Trust me, if you get caught, just play dead!

28
00:03:03,980 --> 00:03:06,300
Don't make eye contact, you're it'll eat you! Ow!

29
00:03:08,420 --> 00:03:10,680
Shut up and take this, moron.

30
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:16,840
What is it? Let me guess, it's some kind of poison drink that'll tear holes in my throat and make me spit fireballs, right?

31
00:03:17,680 --> 00:03:20,940
It's for visiting my brother! Do you have a death wish?

32
00:03:20,940 --> 00:03:28,620
I don't need a thank you present for that. Besides, if this is what a beast like you drinks, I guarantee it's not fit for human consumption.

33
00:03:29,100 --> 00:03:29,800
Don't want it.

34
00:03:30,180 --> 00:03:31,480
Then I'll kill you!

35
00:03:31,820 --> 00:03:34,880
So you came here to thank me and you've already moved on to killing me?

36
00:03:34,960 --> 00:03:36,580
I'll thank you, then kill you!

37
00:03:36,780 --> 00:03:38,500
Man, you do not joke around!

38
00:03:38,500 --> 00:03:40,180
That's because I hate jokes!

39
00:03:40,420 --> 00:03:42,900
Captain, you sure you don't want this?

40
00:03:43,240 --> 00:03:43,640
Fine.

41
00:03:43,900 --> 00:03:44,780
I'll take it.

42
00:03:47,420 --> 00:03:51,380
Oh, I understand now. You're only here to talk to Captain Yami, that's all.

43
00:03:51,500 --> 00:03:55,840
What a relief. In here, I thought I was about to get dragged off to somewhere crazy again.

44
00:03:55,840 --> 00:03:59,660
You three, come with me!

45
00:04:01,160 --> 00:04:06,280
I don't like this! Where are we going? Somewhere bad, I just know it!

46
00:04:06,420 --> 00:04:06,860
Wait!

47
00:04:07,700 --> 00:04:09,640
Why am I getting dragged off to?

48
00:04:10,920 --> 00:04:12,940
Maybe there's gonna be a fight!

49
00:04:14,900 --> 00:04:17,680
I just need to go into it, I guess you're heading out, though.

50
00:04:18,200 --> 00:04:23,240
Hey, Captain! This mad woman is trying to kidnap three of your squad members! Don't you think you should do something?

51
00:04:23,240 --> 00:04:26,100
As long as she leaves, she can do whatever she wants!

52
00:04:26,900 --> 00:04:29,760
Whatever she wants! If you don't help us, we're gonna be far with you!

53
00:04:29,880 --> 00:04:31,700
Come on, Captain, you can't let her do that!

54
00:04:33,020 --> 00:04:36,680
If it's only you three she wants, then you guys must have done something really rotten!

55
00:04:36,960 --> 00:04:39,040
You deserve this, especially you, Luck!

56
00:04:39,960 --> 00:04:43,160
These are the squad members who passed the Royal Knights selection exam.

57
00:04:44,440 --> 00:04:47,040
We made it?

58
00:04:47,260 --> 00:04:48,720
So we're in the Royal Knights?

59
00:04:49,500 --> 00:04:53,160
That means even though I lost the tournament, Yuno didn't get ahead of me!

60
00:04:53,660 --> 00:04:56,660
We're still neck and neck in the race to be the next Wizard King!

61
00:04:57,960 --> 00:04:59,140
This is great!

62
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:01,040
Yay!

63
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:03,380
I'm so happy I made the cut!

64
00:05:03,660 --> 00:05:05,240
Now Asta and I can finally...

65
00:05:05,880 --> 00:05:08,340
I mean, not that I care about anything like that!

66
00:05:08,440 --> 00:05:12,000
I'm glad Asta passed the exam, but only because I'm proud of him as a squadmate!

67
00:05:12,100 --> 00:05:13,660
That's all he is to me, really!

68
00:05:13,820 --> 00:05:15,200
Nothing more and nothing less!

69
00:05:15,320 --> 00:05:16,220
End of story!

70
00:05:16,500 --> 00:05:17,300
Hey, Noelle!

71
00:05:17,500 --> 00:05:19,180
We're gonna be awesome Royal Knights!

72
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:20,660
Yeah, sure.

73
00:05:21,260 --> 00:05:24,520
Just don't rush in on your own again and ruin things for the rest of us.

74
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:28,360
I won't, but I've been training super hard, so it'll still turn out okay if I do.

75
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:28,940
Idiot!

76
00:05:29,020 --> 00:05:31,060
What part of don't do it did you not understand?

77
00:05:31,220 --> 00:05:31,520
Sorry!

78
00:05:31,520 --> 00:05:33,200
Actually, wait.

79
00:05:33,580 --> 00:05:36,540
There was supposed to be one more Black Bull who made the Royal Knights.

80
00:05:36,780 --> 00:05:37,180
Really?

81
00:05:37,660 --> 00:05:38,540
There's one more?

82
00:05:39,080 --> 00:05:41,160
Um, I'm sure it was probably me.

83
00:05:41,580 --> 00:05:42,180
Over here!

84
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:42,940
Pick me!

85
00:05:43,120 --> 00:05:44,080
I don't see him.

86
00:05:44,520 --> 00:05:45,780
I'm right behind you!

87
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:47,880
It's Magna's ring of the Black Bulls here!

88
00:05:47,940 --> 00:05:48,820
It isn't you!

89
00:05:48,820 --> 00:05:50,400
Oh, well.

90
00:05:50,640 --> 00:05:51,980
He received his summons.

91
00:05:53,140 --> 00:05:54,720
I didn't pass after all.

92
00:05:55,560 --> 00:05:56,600
Man, that's rough.

93
00:05:58,220 --> 00:06:00,700
Aw, too bad for you, Magna.

94
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:05,620
Working with the Royal Knights is gonna make me even stronger, so you probably won't be a match for me anymore.

95
00:06:06,460 --> 00:06:07,380
Hold on, Luck.

96
00:06:07,440 --> 00:06:08,600
Be careful what you say.

97
00:06:08,660 --> 00:06:10,640
Rub it in my face all you want to, jerk!

98
00:06:10,860 --> 00:06:13,340
If I fall down seven times, I'll get up eight times.

99
00:06:13,340 --> 00:06:18,060
I just hope that you won't be too intimidated by how buff and awesome I am when you come back to the hideout.

100
00:06:18,060 --> 00:06:20,360
All right, time to start on my training.

101
00:06:20,620 --> 00:06:22,040
Let's do this fun mess, huh?

102
00:06:22,200 --> 00:06:22,560
Me?

103
00:06:23,180 --> 00:06:25,620
But I was just about to pop open this booze.

104
00:06:25,640 --> 00:06:27,340
I want to get stronger and pronto!

105
00:06:27,900 --> 00:06:29,460
No, I have to get stronger.

106
00:06:29,980 --> 00:06:34,680
Well, if you insist, I guess I can make time for you, Mr. Delinquent.

107
00:06:35,820 --> 00:06:37,040
I'm not a delinquent!

108
00:06:37,660 --> 00:06:42,300
Better say your prayers, Luck, and, uh, come back here in one piece.

109
00:06:43,580 --> 00:06:44,060
Sure!

110
00:06:44,340 --> 00:06:45,980
The same goes for you guys.

111
00:06:46,100 --> 00:06:46,420
Gotcha!

112
00:06:47,420 --> 00:06:47,820
Obviously.

113
00:06:48,060 --> 00:06:50,240
Your friends have been cheering for me.

114
00:06:50,940 --> 00:06:51,360
Huh!

115
00:06:51,940 --> 00:06:52,700
Look at him.

116
00:06:53,120 --> 00:06:54,720
Smiles all around.

117
00:06:55,520 --> 00:06:56,560
Give him hell.

118
00:07:01,560 --> 00:07:04,560
From the Silver Eagles, Nils Ruggas!

119
00:07:04,620 --> 00:07:04,880
Here!

120
00:07:05,520 --> 00:07:07,520
The Vice Captain of the Coral Peacocks!

121
00:07:07,780 --> 00:07:09,040
Where is Kirsch Vermillion?

122
00:07:09,480 --> 00:07:09,900
Ugh!

123
00:07:10,180 --> 00:07:13,420
I never tire of hearing the beautiful melody that is my name.

124
00:07:13,420 --> 00:07:18,300
From the Blue Rose Knights, we have Pooley Angel in the flesh!

125
00:07:18,300 --> 00:07:19,680
What do you say, folks?

126
00:07:19,680 --> 00:07:20,560
Did you miss me?

127
00:07:20,560 --> 00:07:21,680
Because I'm back!

128
00:07:21,680 --> 00:07:24,620
And Rheingard of the Green Praying Mantises!

129
00:07:24,620 --> 00:07:25,620
Yes!

130
00:07:25,620 --> 00:07:26,620
Yes!

131
00:07:26,620 --> 00:07:27,620
I'm fired up!

132
00:07:27,620 --> 00:07:28,620
Let's put the Mush in Mushroom!

133
00:07:28,620 --> 00:07:29,620
Yay!

134
00:07:29,620 --> 00:07:35,680
Representing the Aqua Deer, Captain Rill Bormortier, as well as Fragile Tormenta!

135
00:07:35,680 --> 00:07:36,020
Here!

136
00:07:36,220 --> 00:07:36,640
Yup!

137
00:07:37,300 --> 00:07:38,020
That's me!

138
00:07:38,140 --> 00:07:40,580
I'm the failure who lost, even though he's a captain!

139
00:07:40,800 --> 00:07:41,420
Please, sir!

140
00:07:41,780 --> 00:07:43,880
Now's the time to dig deep and stay strong!

141
00:07:44,380 --> 00:07:49,720
And from the Golden Dawn, Hammond Cassius, Klaus Lunettes, Mimosa Vermillion, and Huno!

142
00:07:50,200 --> 00:07:50,880
Sound off!

143
00:07:50,980 --> 00:07:51,280
Here!

144
00:07:51,280 --> 00:07:56,480
I see our squad is the most represented among this group!

145
00:07:56,740 --> 00:07:59,200
Well, we are the best of the best.

146
00:07:59,360 --> 00:08:00,540
Can't say I'm surprised.

147
00:08:00,960 --> 00:08:03,180
It's only natural they'd want you on the team!

148
00:08:03,500 --> 00:08:06,020
I mean, you were basically the MVP of the whole tournament!

149
00:08:06,680 --> 00:08:07,860
Hey, are you listening?

150
00:08:08,520 --> 00:08:10,020
Now then, the Black Bulls!

151
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:12,160
Luck, Voltia, Noel, Silva, and Asta!

152
00:08:12,560 --> 00:08:13,280
Are you present?

153
00:08:14,020 --> 00:08:14,440
Here!

154
00:08:15,500 --> 00:08:16,500
How's that, Yuno?

155
00:08:16,920 --> 00:08:19,200
No way am I gonna let you leave me in the dust!

156
00:08:19,200 --> 00:08:21,300
Even if I stumble, I'll keep going!

157
00:08:21,680 --> 00:08:23,140
And then stumble again.

158
00:08:23,280 --> 00:08:24,560
He is pretty good at that.

159
00:08:24,740 --> 00:08:25,180
Really?

160
00:08:25,400 --> 00:08:26,240
You think so?

161
00:08:26,380 --> 00:08:27,020
Thanks a lot!

162
00:08:27,100 --> 00:08:28,420
Wait, what did you say?!

163
00:08:28,420 --> 00:08:29,720
You know it's the truth.

164
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:32,040
Okay, but I'm gonna not give it up, too!

165
00:08:32,260 --> 00:08:34,240
I can vouch for the stumbling part.

166
00:08:34,520 --> 00:08:35,140
Oh, Asta.

167
00:08:35,520 --> 00:08:38,640
I'm so happy you and I get a chance to work together again!

168
00:08:38,920 --> 00:08:39,340
Yeah!

169
00:08:39,540 --> 00:08:40,240
Should be fun!

170
00:08:41,460 --> 00:08:43,560
Let me introduce myself as well!

171
00:08:44,120 --> 00:08:46,600
As you may know, I am Meryl Leona Vermillion,

172
00:08:47,040 --> 00:08:48,720
the captain of the Royal Knights!

173
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:49,640
No way!

174
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:52,200
I didn't know she would be in charge of this thing!

175
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:53,600
Come on!

176
00:08:53,760 --> 00:08:54,820
Are you guys not surprised?

177
00:08:55,480 --> 00:08:55,840
No.

178
00:08:56,180 --> 00:08:57,500
I had assumed it would be her.

179
00:08:58,160 --> 00:08:59,880
She was the one who came to get us,

180
00:08:59,900 --> 00:09:01,120
and now she's doing the roll call.

181
00:09:01,440 --> 00:09:02,240
What's wrong?

182
00:09:02,740 --> 00:09:03,100
Nothing!

183
00:09:03,480 --> 00:09:04,580
Everything's peachy, Captain!

184
00:09:04,660 --> 00:09:05,060
I swear!

185
00:09:05,580 --> 00:09:07,560
Our captain really is something special!

186
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:10,360
She was the one who rallied the Crimson Lion Kings

187
00:09:10,360 --> 00:09:12,180
after what happened to Captain Foygolion!

188
00:09:12,820 --> 00:09:13,320
Right.

189
00:09:13,320 --> 00:09:18,100
I personally wish that Tidal had gone to our captain Vongent's,

190
00:09:18,320 --> 00:09:20,900
but he's busy commanding security forces in the capital,

191
00:09:21,240 --> 00:09:22,100
so she'll have to do.

192
00:09:22,700 --> 00:09:25,620
If anyone has a complaint, then please don't hold back!

193
00:09:25,800 --> 00:09:28,520
I certainly won't hold back when I crush you for it!

194
00:09:28,520 --> 00:09:30,440
Really?

195
00:09:31,440 --> 00:09:33,260
Now then, let's get back to business.

196
00:09:34,080 --> 00:09:35,900
After enduring a cutthroat competition,

197
00:09:36,400 --> 00:09:39,000
you 16 have been selected to be a part of this team.

198
00:09:39,560 --> 00:09:40,840
Assuming there are no objections,

199
00:09:41,300 --> 00:09:43,260
I hereby announce myself as your leader

200
00:09:43,260 --> 00:09:46,720
from this moment until the eye of the Midnight Sun is annihilated!

201
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:47,600
Yes, ma'am!

202
00:09:48,380 --> 00:09:48,640
Hmm?

203
00:09:49,060 --> 00:09:50,900
One, two, three...

204
00:09:50,900 --> 00:09:51,880
Someone's missing.

205
00:09:52,560 --> 00:09:54,540
Does he think promptness is a joke?

206
00:09:54,740 --> 00:09:55,760
I'm a bit late.

207
00:09:56,240 --> 00:09:57,260
Sorry, guys.

208
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:06,780
Well, well.

209
00:10:07,140 --> 00:10:08,200
A class clown.

210
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:12,860
Come on, let's be reasonable.

211
00:10:13,040 --> 00:10:14,400
If I'm entrusting my life to you,

212
00:10:14,400 --> 00:10:16,880
I'd be stupid not to find out what you're made of.

213
00:10:17,020 --> 00:10:18,720
Anyway, the pleasure's all mine.

214
00:10:19,360 --> 00:10:20,700
Hey, it's you again!

215
00:10:22,380 --> 00:10:22,820
Wait!

216
00:10:23,300 --> 00:10:25,180
Why are you wearing a Black Bull's robe?

217
00:10:34,680 --> 00:10:35,120
You!

218
00:10:35,420 --> 00:10:37,900
Explain to me why you're wearing that robe right now!

219
00:10:38,840 --> 00:10:39,320
Idiot.

220
00:10:39,660 --> 00:10:41,040
I'm one of the Black Bulls.

221
00:10:41,100 --> 00:10:42,520
Why wouldn't I be wearing the uniform?

222
00:10:44,400 --> 00:10:44,880
Wow!

223
00:10:45,560 --> 00:10:46,560
You're a Black Bull?

224
00:10:46,740 --> 00:10:47,860
Like our Black Bulls?

225
00:10:47,920 --> 00:10:48,580
That's it!

226
00:10:48,840 --> 00:10:50,640
I want to know everything in detail!

227
00:10:52,020 --> 00:10:55,320
All of a sudden, you got me feeling nostalgic for the old days.

228
00:10:55,780 --> 00:10:59,180
I used to go around beating the daylights out of Magic Nights one by one,

229
00:10:59,260 --> 00:11:01,160
and I had some pretty good reasons for doing it.

230
00:11:01,160 --> 00:11:02,400
You hurt Magic Nights?

231
00:11:02,480 --> 00:11:02,780
Really?

232
00:11:03,420 --> 00:11:04,420
That is not okay!

233
00:11:04,580 --> 00:11:05,160
Chill out.

234
00:11:05,160 --> 00:11:07,860
I just told you I had a good reason for it, didn't I?

235
00:11:08,140 --> 00:11:09,140
Here's what happened.

236
00:11:09,500 --> 00:11:14,640
Not too long ago, I ran into this outrageous monster of a guy and ended up taking a serious beating.

237
00:11:14,640 --> 00:11:18,880
What's your problem?

238
00:11:22,480 --> 00:11:23,180
What's this?

239
00:11:23,460 --> 00:11:25,900
I like you, so I want to give you one of these.

240
00:11:26,580 --> 00:11:28,960
If you don't like it, you can toss it.

241
00:11:29,120 --> 00:11:30,920
Stop playing games with me, Magic Nights.

242
00:11:31,200 --> 00:11:32,620
Like I'd be caught dead in this.

243
00:11:33,320 --> 00:11:36,500
Besides, I don't think you're supposed to go handing these things out like candy.

244
00:11:36,500 --> 00:11:39,800
Oh, I wasn't expecting you to know that.

245
00:11:41,080 --> 00:11:44,320
Well, if you ever do feel like putting it on, then be my guest.

246
00:11:49,400 --> 00:11:51,000
And that's how it went down.

247
00:11:51,320 --> 00:11:55,320
Captain Yami scouted me for the Black Bulls and made me an official member of the squad.

248
00:11:55,460 --> 00:11:56,920
But that's not fair, Zerks!

249
00:11:56,980 --> 00:11:58,340
You're obviously playing dirty!

250
00:11:58,660 --> 00:12:00,820
I had to work so hard to get in!

251
00:12:01,020 --> 00:12:03,040
Yeah, by the way, my name's not Zerks.

252
00:12:03,300 --> 00:12:05,640
I'm Zora Ideale, and I outrank you.

253
00:12:06,500 --> 00:12:08,460
What's with this Zora stuff?

254
00:12:08,740 --> 00:12:10,100
Don't tell me that's your name!

255
00:12:10,600 --> 00:12:13,840
If I'm not mistaken, that's exactly what I just said, runt.

256
00:12:13,960 --> 00:12:15,500
Why would you lie about that?

257
00:12:16,020 --> 00:12:17,160
You know what they say?

258
00:12:17,300 --> 00:12:19,880
To fool your enemies, you have to start with your friends.

259
00:12:19,900 --> 00:12:20,120
What?

260
00:12:20,360 --> 00:12:21,320
But who's your enemy?

261
00:12:21,580 --> 00:12:23,100
And are you really ranked higher than me?

262
00:12:23,440 --> 00:12:24,200
That's right.

263
00:12:24,340 --> 00:12:25,520
So start groveling.

264
00:12:25,560 --> 00:12:26,160
Forget it!

265
00:12:26,420 --> 00:12:27,980
You start apologizing!

266
00:12:28,300 --> 00:12:30,640
Not cool Zerks, I mean Zulub, whatever!

267
00:12:31,240 --> 00:12:32,340
My head hurts!

268
00:12:32,540 --> 00:12:33,500
This is confusing!

269
00:12:34,180 --> 00:12:36,260
Damn, you're a noisy little guy, aren't ya?

270
00:12:36,500 --> 00:12:37,220
And this is it.

271
00:12:37,460 --> 00:12:40,360
From now on, I'm gonna set my sights on being a super mage.

272
00:12:40,540 --> 00:12:41,700
A real magic knight.

273
00:12:41,960 --> 00:12:45,740
Here, as a souvenir of our reunion, have a rainbow stink bug.

274
00:12:48,080 --> 00:12:50,960
It comes at you in waves!

275
00:12:52,680 --> 00:12:55,040
Hey, it's not so bad once you're used to it.

276
00:12:55,200 --> 00:12:56,520
I highly doubt that!

277
00:12:56,740 --> 00:12:57,600
No, you're right!

278
00:12:57,780 --> 00:12:59,680
It's burning off all my nose hairs!

279
00:13:00,360 --> 00:13:01,260
You're tough!

280
00:13:01,320 --> 00:13:02,300
We should spar sometime!

281
00:13:02,840 --> 00:13:05,860
I'm hearing an awful lot of tipper-jabber from over here!

282
00:13:06,500 --> 00:13:07,260
Sorry, ma'am!

283
00:13:08,100 --> 00:13:08,640
Hey, wait.

284
00:13:08,820 --> 00:13:09,620
It's just us.

285
00:13:10,300 --> 00:13:13,860
Everyone else left ages ago to change into their royal knight's robes!

286
00:13:13,860 --> 00:13:16,300
You mean we get special uniforms and everything?

287
00:13:16,840 --> 00:13:18,940
This day keeps getting cooler by the minute!

288
00:13:19,740 --> 00:13:23,420
They were designed for our fight against the Eye of the Midnight Sun, which means they'll

289
00:13:23,420 --> 00:13:25,700
be exceptionally resistant to magic attacks.

290
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:28,500
Now quit wasting my time and go put yours on!

291
00:13:28,660 --> 00:13:30,280
Hey, check this out!

292
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:32,100
Handsome, huh?

293
00:13:32,100 --> 00:13:36,300
This thing is practically made for and I've fallen in love all over again!

294
00:13:37,800 --> 00:13:40,900
I never imagined you and I would be wearing the same robe, Asta.

295
00:13:41,440 --> 00:13:44,400
It's not like you'll ever hold a candle to my magic abilities.

296
00:13:45,100 --> 00:13:47,200
I'm going to become the next Wizard King.

297
00:13:47,740 --> 00:13:48,440
No way!

298
00:13:48,840 --> 00:13:49,620
I will!

299
00:13:50,280 --> 00:13:51,120
Keep dreaming.

300
00:13:52,860 --> 00:13:53,740
All right!

301
00:13:54,020 --> 00:13:55,960
Is everyone wearing their robes now?

302
00:13:55,960 --> 00:14:03,500
Oh, it's so beautiful to think a mere man-made garment would suit a god so perfectly.

303
00:14:03,740 --> 00:14:06,940
To think your narcissism would give me such a perfect dirge to puke.

304
00:14:07,160 --> 00:14:08,720
They certainly make it official.

305
00:14:09,180 --> 00:14:13,500
And I must say, they're awfully flattering on those of us who sport a more robust figure.

306
00:14:13,720 --> 00:14:14,560
That's right!

307
00:14:14,740 --> 00:14:16,140
I'm ready for anything!

308
00:14:16,660 --> 00:14:18,380
I suppose they're not too terrible.

309
00:14:19,380 --> 00:14:21,980
How come mine is so short?

310
00:14:22,220 --> 00:14:23,960
Yours is the only one like that!

311
00:14:24,360 --> 00:14:25,920
Asta, don't joke around.

312
00:14:26,280 --> 00:14:27,280
But I'm not joking!

313
00:14:27,740 --> 00:14:29,680
This is just how I was when I put it on!

314
00:14:30,640 --> 00:14:33,940
I guess when you're half a man, you only get half a robe.

315
00:14:34,280 --> 00:14:35,500
We ran out of fabric.

316
00:14:36,600 --> 00:14:40,660
You see, apart from you, Lod, we ended up calling upon some extra people to help out.

317
00:14:41,620 --> 00:14:42,880
Some extra people?

318
00:14:43,880 --> 00:14:47,240
These magic knights may not have participated in the selection exam,

319
00:14:47,240 --> 00:14:49,800
but their special skills will be indispensable.

320
00:14:50,980 --> 00:14:53,560
Meet Cob Portaport and Shiram Tiam!

321
00:14:53,560 --> 00:15:01,540
Shirin's stone creation magic can summon a mock-up of the enemy's hideout and give us an idea of the magic power possessed by the mages hiding inside.

322
00:15:01,540 --> 00:15:05,260
And Cobb can wield the ever-useful spatial magic.

323
00:15:05,260 --> 00:15:09,260
We've enlisted his support since Fen'ral Rulakase is still in recovery.

324
00:15:09,260 --> 00:15:12,980
Last but not least...

325
00:15:12,980 --> 00:15:14,700
Nozel Silva!

326
00:15:14,700 --> 00:15:17,200
He'll be joining us as well.

327
00:15:17,200 --> 00:15:19,780
My brother's here.

328
00:15:20,620 --> 00:15:23,100
The Silver Eagle's captain will be fighting with us?

329
00:15:23,260 --> 00:15:24,400
I'm glad we have him.

330
00:15:24,880 --> 00:15:25,320
Definitely.

331
00:15:26,100 --> 00:15:29,920
Having the opportunity to fight with somebody like him, it's really an honor.

332
00:15:29,920 --> 00:15:32,640
I was certain you would refuse my offer.

333
00:15:33,100 --> 00:15:34,760
What caused you to change your mind?

334
00:15:35,120 --> 00:15:36,920
Please spare me the idle chit-chat.

335
00:15:37,380 --> 00:15:39,360
I'm only acting on orders from His Majesty.

336
00:15:40,360 --> 00:15:42,880
With these three, the royal knights are complete!

337
00:15:43,280 --> 00:15:45,200
I'm expecting great things!

338
00:15:45,660 --> 00:15:46,100
Hey!

339
00:15:46,380 --> 00:15:48,040
That's not very nice of you, Nozel!

340
00:15:48,180 --> 00:15:51,360
What makes you think you can just waltz in here and become one of the royal knights?

341
00:15:51,620 --> 00:15:54,160
I mean, you didn't even compete in the selection exam!

342
00:15:54,600 --> 00:15:58,780
A better question is why you chose to take the test in the first place despite being a captain.

343
00:15:58,780 --> 00:16:02,300
Huh? I thought that was the only way in!

344
00:16:03,080 --> 00:16:03,600
Salutations!

345
00:16:04,140 --> 00:16:06,340
The Eye of the Midnight Sun is strong!

346
00:16:06,520 --> 00:16:11,480
So we're lucky to have the help of our fearless magic knight captains, especially those who possess royal blood.

347
00:16:11,580 --> 00:16:14,620
You are called the royal knights after all. Get it?

348
00:16:14,980 --> 00:16:16,100
Hey, it's the king.

349
00:16:16,660 --> 00:16:20,900
Let's give a warm welcome to His Majesty, King Augustus Kira Clover XIII!

350
00:16:22,100 --> 00:16:24,820
Oh dear! She's terribly intimidating!

351
00:16:25,080 --> 00:16:27,220
I'm not used to being addressed by my full name!

352
00:16:27,220 --> 00:16:28,980
Listen well, knights!

353
00:16:29,460 --> 00:16:31,520
You mustn't sully the proud name of-

354
00:16:31,520 --> 00:16:34,840
As I'm sure you're aware, victory is all we need!

355
00:16:35,260 --> 00:16:38,900
The Eye of the Midnight Sun is a contemptible terrorist organization!

356
00:16:39,380 --> 00:16:43,820
If we don't pull it up by the roots ourselves, our nation will never know peace!

357
00:16:43,820 --> 00:16:51,900
We may have successfully banded together to drive them out during the attack on the royal capital, but the cost was unspeakably great.

358
00:16:52,340 --> 00:16:57,580
My fool of a brother, Fuegolion, fell for their scheme and remains bedridden to this day!

359
00:16:57,580 --> 00:17:05,420
Based on what we've learned from the operatives we've captured thus far, their leader is a mage called Lict, who carries a four-leaf guimoire!

360
00:17:05,420 --> 00:17:09,760
Their three mightiest fighters once made up a group called the Third Eye.

361
00:17:09,760 --> 00:17:20,260
The Eye of the Midnight Sun intends to gather magic stones because they believe that doing so will allow them to be reborn into their true forms and come to possess incredible power!

362
00:17:21,360 --> 00:17:23,060
They have all but three stones!

363
00:17:23,760 --> 00:17:26,880
Fortunately, we've been able to recover two of them before they were located.

364
00:17:26,880 --> 00:17:31,200
What's more, we've defeated the Third Eye's Veto, a wielder of beast magic.

365
00:17:31,460 --> 00:17:35,120
And for now, we've deterred Fauna and her fire spirit, Salamander.

366
00:17:36,240 --> 00:17:40,440
The final member of the Third Eye is the copy magic user known as Raya.

367
00:17:40,920 --> 00:17:47,220
He and their leader Lict are, without a doubt, the greatest and most powerful enemies we'll face during our campaign.

368
00:17:48,320 --> 00:17:51,160
Their stronghold is the last line of defense they have.

369
00:17:51,320 --> 00:17:54,740
If we attack it, the enemy is likely to put up all-out resistance!

370
00:17:54,740 --> 00:17:59,160
We may see some casualties, but victory will still be ours in the end!

371
00:17:59,540 --> 00:18:01,640
Every life in the kingdom is at stake!

372
00:18:02,120 --> 00:18:07,140
If anyone here is uncomfortable with that, then I'll kill you now and save the enemy the trouble!

373
00:18:07,660 --> 00:18:08,760
Are you ready?

374
00:18:09,200 --> 00:18:09,580
Now!

375
00:18:10,700 --> 00:18:14,240
And now, His Majesty King Augustus, Kira Clover the Thirteen!

376
00:18:15,380 --> 00:18:17,340
There's no need to raise your voice!

377
00:18:17,460 --> 00:18:19,660
I'm done. Feel free to continue with your address.

378
00:18:20,460 --> 00:18:21,340
Thank you.

379
00:18:21,340 --> 00:18:28,100
Continue, she tells me, after she so rudely interrupted me with such a lengthy spiel.

380
00:18:28,340 --> 00:18:30,180
Why, there's nothing left for me to say!

381
00:18:31,080 --> 00:18:31,640
Ahem!

382
00:18:32,340 --> 00:18:34,260
Well, do your best, Royal Knights!

383
00:18:35,000 --> 00:18:35,520
Dismissed!

384
00:18:36,680 --> 00:18:37,120
Uh...

385
00:18:37,120 --> 00:18:38,800
Was that it?

386
00:18:39,360 --> 00:18:39,580
Hmm.

387
00:18:41,940 --> 00:18:42,880
Wait, Your Majesty!

388
00:18:43,360 --> 00:18:45,920
Where do we find the Eye of the Midnight Sun's hideout, anyway?

389
00:18:45,920 --> 00:18:47,420
Oh my!

390
00:18:47,680 --> 00:18:50,500
For a vexatious commoner, he brings up a good question!

391
00:18:50,980 --> 00:18:51,840
You see...

392
00:18:51,840 --> 00:18:54,760
Rest assured we will be making our way to their base immediately!

393
00:18:55,460 --> 00:18:56,260
Listen up!

394
00:18:56,640 --> 00:19:02,040
It lies in the floating dungeon found within the strong magic region called Gravitostones!

395
00:19:02,040 --> 00:19:15,980
Oh, wow! It sure is late!

396
00:19:16,100 --> 00:19:16,640
Hey, Raya!

397
00:19:17,260 --> 00:19:20,620
As I expected, you're wearing the same cowardly expression as usual.

398
00:19:21,020 --> 00:19:22,940
Oh, come on! Don't be like that!

399
00:19:23,100 --> 00:19:24,420
We should go get some drinks together!

400
00:19:24,560 --> 00:19:25,740
No, forget it!

401
00:19:25,740 --> 00:19:28,620
You're a lightweight!

402
00:19:31,340 --> 00:19:33,060
Oh, hey! There you are!

403
00:19:35,120 --> 00:19:36,120
Hello, Raya!

404
00:19:36,600 --> 00:19:37,900
What took you so long?

405
00:19:38,280 --> 00:19:40,500
Let me guess, waking up is a pain too now?

406
00:19:40,640 --> 00:19:41,600
You're the worst!

407
00:19:41,820 --> 00:19:43,060
Get off my case!

408
00:19:43,920 --> 00:19:44,660
Hey, Patry!

409
00:19:44,880 --> 00:19:47,880
I can see you're still clinging on to Licht like nobody's business!

410
00:19:49,200 --> 00:19:54,500
He's gonna belong to a human after tomorrow's big ceremony, so you better start letting go of him!

411
00:19:54,500 --> 00:19:58,140
Leave me alone, Raya. That's my choice to make, not yours.

412
00:19:58,780 --> 00:19:59,720
Excuse me?

413
00:19:59,980 --> 00:20:03,720
It's alright. Even after we get married, Licht will still belong to everybody.

414
00:20:04,520 --> 00:20:07,200
Man, human princesses are so generous.

415
00:20:07,660 --> 00:20:10,000
I'd be careful what I say if I were you, though, Tetya.

416
00:20:10,480 --> 00:20:13,820
Before long, there won't be any room in his busy schedule to spend time with you.

417
00:20:14,380 --> 00:20:16,460
You don't have to be so blunt about things.

418
00:20:16,760 --> 00:20:18,180
Patry knows what to expect.

419
00:20:18,520 --> 00:20:22,200
So what's it like, knowing that you'll be a father in a few months' time?

420
00:20:22,200 --> 00:20:25,820
I can sense that the mana has blessed our lives as well.

421
00:20:26,120 --> 00:20:29,660
When our child arrives, we know that your kind will welcome it.

422
00:20:29,980 --> 00:20:30,740
We're quite thrilled.

423
00:20:32,660 --> 00:20:35,060
This little one here is the key to our future.

424
00:20:35,780 --> 00:20:38,060
The bridge to unite elves and humankind.

425
00:20:38,620 --> 00:20:40,500
Congratulations, Licht and Tetya.

426
00:20:41,040 --> 00:20:41,560
Congratulations!

427
00:20:41,560 --> 00:20:51,820
That was odd.

428
00:20:52,180 --> 00:20:52,840
What a dream.

429
00:20:53,220 --> 00:20:54,240
Kind of faint, though.

430
00:20:55,420 --> 00:20:57,340
It's almost time to wake up.

431
00:20:57,340 --> 00:21:27,320
It's almost time to wake up.

432
00:21:27,340 --> 00:21:57,320
It's almost time to wake up.

433
00:21:57,340 --> 00:22:27,320
It's almost time to wake up.

434
00:22:27,320 --> 00:22:31,320
CLOVER GLIPS!

435
00:22:31,320 --> 00:22:35,320
ROADS OF PLENTY!

436
00:22:35,320 --> 00:22:37,320
PART ONE!

437
00:22:37,320 --> 00:22:40,320
Wow, we get special police uniforms and everything?!

438
00:22:40,320 --> 00:22:42,320
This deck keeps getting cooler by the minute!

439
00:22:42,320 --> 00:22:45,320
They were designed for investigating criminal activity!

440
00:22:45,320 --> 00:22:47,320
Now go and put yours on!

441
00:22:50,320 --> 00:22:52,320
This doesn't feel right!

442
00:22:52,320 --> 00:22:54,320
Why is mine different than all the other ones?

443
00:22:54,320 --> 00:22:56,320
PART TWO!

444
00:22:56,320 --> 00:22:59,320
Wow, so we get special school uniforms now?!

445
00:22:59,320 --> 00:23:02,320
That's way cooler than what you gave me before!

446
00:23:02,320 --> 00:23:05,320
They're made for wearing to academic institutions!

447
00:23:05,320 --> 00:23:07,320
Now go and put yours on!

448
00:23:09,320 --> 00:23:12,320
Hold on a second, how young do you think I am?!

449
00:23:12,320 --> 00:23:14,320
PART THREE!

450
00:23:14,320 --> 00:23:17,320
Wow, so we get special doctor uniforms to wear?!

451
00:23:17,320 --> 00:23:20,320
I'm pretty sure it doesn't get much cooler than that!

452
00:23:20,320 --> 00:23:23,320
These outfits are designed for practicing medicine!

453
00:23:23,320 --> 00:23:25,320
Now go and put yours on!

454
00:23:26,320 --> 00:23:27,320
PART THREE!

455
00:23:29,320 --> 00:23:31,320
Really? Why can't I have a cool one?!

456
00:23:31,320 --> 00:23:33,320
This might hurt...

457
00:23:35,320 --> 00:23:38,320
Finally, it's time for us to fight the Midnight Sun!

458
00:23:38,320 --> 00:23:42,320
No matter what, the Royal Knights are gonna protect the kingdom and everyone in it!

459
00:23:42,320 --> 00:23:44,320
Black Clover, page 88!

460
00:23:44,320 --> 00:23:46,320
Storming the eye of the Midnight Sun's hideout!

461
00:23:46,320 --> 00:23:48,320
Our new captain is pretty strong!

462
00:23:48,320 --> 00:23:49,320
And scary too!

463
00:23:49,320 --> 00:23:50,320
Me too!

464
00:23:50,320 --> 00:23:51,320
Me too!

465
00:23:51,320 --> 00:23:52,320
Me too!

